WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.001 --> 00:00:02.294
We’re talking about discovering

00:00:02.294 --> 00:00:03.629
life on another planet.

00:00:05.172 --> 00:00:07.132
It’ll change our concept
of who we are...

00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:09.676
Where we came from...

00:00:12.304 --> 00:00:13.305
And where we’re going.

00:00:14.431 --> 00:00:16.642
♪♪

00:00:17.226 --> 00:00:19.186
In season 3 of For All Mankind,

00:00:19.186 --> 00:00:21.396
we’re jumping almost 10 years

00:00:21.396 --> 00:00:23.523
into our history timeline.

00:00:24.566 --> 00:00:26.109
It’s now the 90’s

00:00:26.109 --> 00:00:28.779
an era with a huge
explosion of technology.

00:00:29.363 --> 00:00:30.781
We have bases on the moon,

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:32.908
we have a hotel in orbit...

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:34.368
The space race is booming.

00:00:34.868 --> 00:00:36.870
And you start to
see space tourism.

00:00:37.537 --> 00:00:39.957
And the idea of reaching
further into space

00:00:40.457 --> 00:00:41.959
is the main
driving force

00:00:42.668 --> 00:00:44.169
in the race to Mars.

00:00:45.045 --> 00:00:46.880
The whole world waits to see

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:47.965
who will land first.

00:00:48.632 --> 00:00:49.508
We’re living in a world

00:00:49.508 --> 00:00:51.426
where getting to
Mars is a possibility

00:00:51.551 --> 00:00:54.888
and it’s a race between
superpowers: NASA,

00:00:55.931 --> 00:00:56.932
the Soviets,

00:00:57.474 --> 00:00:59.476
and now a company called Helios.

00:00:59.726 --> 00:01:00.602
We will propel this

00:01:00.602 --> 00:01:01.812
one-of-a-kind
spacecraft

00:01:02.479 --> 00:01:04.481
on an epic journey
of exploration...

00:01:04.690 --> 00:01:05.565
to Mars.

00:01:06.733 --> 00:01:09.278
Helios is a private company

00:01:09.278 --> 00:01:11.530
and truly wants to do
something groundbreaking.

00:01:11.571 --> 00:01:12.781
♪♪

00:01:12.990 --> 00:01:14.658
You are going up against the two

00:01:14.658 --> 00:01:17.786
most powerful nations
in the world.

00:01:17.786 --> 00:01:19.454
All of these different
groups are going

00:01:19.454 --> 00:01:21.540
head-to-head to get
to Mars first,

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:23.709
and the politics of the Cold War

00:01:23.709 --> 00:01:25.919
are now much
more complicated.

00:01:27.337 --> 00:01:29.715
Because their
commitment and dedication

00:01:29.715 --> 00:01:31.466
has spanned three decades,

00:01:31.466 --> 00:01:33.093
it takes an already
high stakes situation

00:01:33.093 --> 00:01:34.511
and makes it even
higher stakes.

00:01:34.511 --> 00:01:36.138
The US of A is
gonna win this race.

00:01:36.471 --> 00:01:38.098
There's a sense that, that

00:01:38.098 --> 00:01:40.017
competition brings
everyone together.

00:01:40.017 --> 00:01:41.059
The future...

00:01:41.059 --> 00:01:42.185
Belongs to all of us!

00:01:42.686 --> 00:01:45.439
This can support large
scale human colonization.

00:01:46.565 --> 00:01:48.859
This race to Mars is definitely

00:01:48.859 --> 00:01:50.736
just the tip of the iceberg.

00:01:51.403 --> 00:01:54.614
We will see them begin
to establish a new colony

00:01:54.614 --> 00:01:57.951
like the early settlers
start a new Jamestown.

00:01:59.453 --> 00:02:01.955
And we see all the
difficulties and challenges

00:02:01.955 --> 00:02:04.291
and the sacrifices
it takes to get there.

00:02:04.833 --> 00:02:06.126
Our mission is to create a

00:02:06.126 --> 00:02:07.753
sustainable base and survive.

00:02:08.211 --> 00:02:09.212
Oh my God.

00:02:09.880 --> 00:02:11.506
And the idea of
what we can do,

00:02:11.506 --> 00:02:12.883
and where we
can go from here.

00:02:13.633 --> 00:02:15.635
To be explorers, and
things that make us

00:02:15.635 --> 00:02:18.472
better as human beings
and do great things.

00:02:19.431 --> 00:02:20.724
That's what's gonna push mankind

00:02:20.724 --> 00:02:21.850
to make the next leap forward:

00:02:21.850 --> 00:02:24.603
colonizing Mars and
the Moons of Saturn.

00:02:24.978 --> 00:02:26.271
What if this is our chance?

00:02:27.272 --> 00:02:29.524
Space truly is
the final frontier.

00:02:35.572 --> 00:02:38.075
Human beings are
always gonna wanna see....

00:02:39.910 --> 00:02:41.578
What's over that next hill?

00:02:47.376 --> 00:02:48.627
It's only the beginning.

